      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL I ASK (1) generally breaks well and with clear running can clear the draw. Latest effort finished 2nd over 400m at this track beaten 4 lengths (23.95) behind Cheer For Ditto in a Maiden on August 16. Looks hard to beat with even luck. BLACK SABOTAGE (6) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 2 lengths back in third (18.02) at this track in a Maiden over 305m. Expected to be in this for a long way. CADILLAC SNOOP (4) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 305m behind Miss Chapo (18.73) in a Grade 6/MDN. Was in the money prior to that. Has ability and is one of the better chances. BLACK DESTINY (2) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
